WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

NOTE
Scene captions for a silent screen recording of Theia 3.4.0 on Windows.
Written from the recording itself, scene by scene; the times were checked
against the frames. The player is shown in French in the recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.400
Download the setup for your system from the latest release page on GitHub.

2
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:38.000
Run it in a terminal. A short form asks for the language, what this machine is for, where to keep data, the port, the network name and the folders that hold your films.

3
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.200
It shows its plan; nothing is written before you confirm. Then it installs.

4
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:55.900
Start Theia Player from the entries the installer added.

5
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:02.900
Home: where you stopped, and what was added recently.

6
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.900
A film page, with its synopsis and its cast.

7
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:17.400
The film and series lists, a series with its episodes, then search.

8
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:36.400
Settings: interface language, playback, subtitles, viewing statistics, server address and updates.

9
00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:44.000
The profile editor, where a profile's name and photo are changed (PNG, JPEG or WebP). The recording opens it and changes nothing.
